{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--product-skills","name":"product-skills","description":"Use when coordinating product work across the 12 bundled product sub-skills (RICE, OKRs, UX research, design tokens, competitive teardown, analytics, experiments, discovery, roadmaps, spec-to-repo, landing pages, SaaS scaffolding) or the 4 standalone product-team plugins (user stories, Apple HIG, code-to-PRD, research summarizer). Triggers on 'help me prioritize', 'plan a product experiment', 'we ship features nobody uses', 'run the discovery loop', 'is our OST sound'. Forks context to route to one sub-skill via a deterministic signal router and returns a digest; can also drive a continuous-discovery loop (Torres cadence tracker + OST linter as machine gates) or a full goal→plan→execute→verify→close run through the repo-wide agent-harness. Distinct from project-management (how to deliver vs what to build), marketing/landing (from-scratch pages), and engineering/agent-harness (the generic loop engine this orchestrator plugs into).","category":"Video & audio","tags":["product","skills","when","coordinating","work","across","12","bundled","sub","rice","okrs","ux","research","design","tokens","competitive","teardown","analytics"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"product-team/skills/product-skills","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/product-team/skills/product-skills","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":10,"bytes":49140,"sha256":"50493409784ab8d70c66a7823ffce61b0758efd72a479a0273d41c2d88c9e6cb","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"product-team/skills/product-skills/SKILL.md","bytes":10481,"sha256":"50493409784ab8d70c66a7823ffce61b07